\newlabel{odmb}{{1.5}{6}{Top side of one of the ODMBs produced for the ME1/1 upgrade. The ODMB is a 9U VME board, $400 mm \times 367 mm$ in size. The upgraded ODMB7 will be very similar to the ODMB, while the ODMB5 will have a different front panel configuration with copper connections to the five DCFEB(v2)s. \relax }{figure.caption.17}{}}
